## Apiary toolkit

This repo was spawned by `/incubator` and ships with the apiary toolkit wired up. Invoke any apiary subsystem via the launcher:

```bash
python .claude/apiary/launch.py <subsystem>/<script>.py [args]
```

This repo's apiary state (scribe notes, budgeter data, etc.) is managed centrally by the main apiary install — it lives under the main apiary's `.repos/<name>-<id>/` store, not in this repo. The launcher resolves it automatically, so you invoke tools the same way regardless of where the data sits. Common entry points:

```bash
python .claude/apiary/launch.py scribe/notes.py list             # operational notes for this project
python .claude/apiary/launch.py scribe/notes.py list --type context  # specs and project context
python .claude/apiary/launch.py budgeter/report.py --since 7d    # session cost rollup
```

The full project spec produced during incubation lives as a `context`-type scribe note in this repo — run `scribe/notes.py list --type context` to find it.
